      },
      "message": "feat(mcp): generate the agent tool reference and local prompt from the tool table\n\nmcp::catalog reads the live MCP tool table and makes the Markdown tool\nreference (camcraft-cli mcp reference, committed at\ndocs/agents/mcp-tools.md), the compact local-model prompt (camcraft-cli\nmcp prompt) and the shared rules that the Prompt-JSON context now starts\nwith. Thin wrappers for Codex/Antigravity (.agents/skills) and Gemini\n(GEMINI.md) point to the guide and the reference. The MCP guide names\nthe 34 live tools it lacked. mcp_doc_drift pins the reference, the dead\nand missing tool names, and the shared rules.\n\nThe .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md gaps fix is held on the issue.\n\nRefs #1947\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
